 "message": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff; padding:14px; border-radius:6px;max-width:520px;\">\n<h3  style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; color: #b45309;\">⚠️ Visitor Pass Expiring Tomorrow</h3>\n<p>The following multi-day visitor pass expires on <b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">{{ doc.pass_valid_until }}</b>. Please extend or close it before then.</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0;table-layout:fixed;\">\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Pass</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.name }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Visitor</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.visitor_full_name }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Type</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.visitor_type }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Host</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.host_name or '-' }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Expires On</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\"><b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">{{ doc.pass_valid_until }}</b></td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><a style=\"color: #1e40af;\" href=\"{{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}